# The build context is scripts/perf-reliability/ci, never the repository root.
# Deny everything first so a future file cannot accidentally enter the image.
*
!Dockerfile
!entrypoint.py

# Defense in depth: even if the allowlist above grows, these never belong in an
# image layer. The patterns also document why the root context is forbidden.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/target
**/target/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/connection.json
**/evidence
**/evidence/**
